{"format":1,"key":"zone:westfall","path":"/lore/zone/westfall","name":"Westfall","kind":"zone","label":"Zone","zone":{"key":"westfall","name":"Westfall","path":"/lore/zone/westfall"},"levels":"Levels 10-20","description":"Once the fertile breadbasket of the Kingdom of Stormwind, Westfall has collapsed into a windswept, neglected territory overrun by outlaws. Deprived of…","intro":[],"clips":[{"id":"zone:westfall","part":"narration","anchor":"story","title":"The story","paras":["Once the fertile breadbasket of the Kingdom of Stormwind, Westfall has collapsed into a windswept, neglected territory overrun by outlaws. Deprived of official crown support and military garrisons, its surviving homesteaders cling to their farms while the Defias Brotherhood tightens its grip from the abandoned mining town of Moonbrook.","For generations, Westfall fed the Kingdom of Stormwind. Its rolling pastures and wheat fields flourished until the aftermath of the Second War brought financial exhaustion and political neglect. When the kingdom poured its resources elsewhere and failed to maintain its garrisons, the territory grew fallow. Today, barren pastures, howling coastal gusts, rogue harvest golems, and raiding Riverpaw gnolls make daily survival a constant trial for the stubborn few who refuse to abandon their homesteads."],"hash":"343283","voices":{"male-narrator":{"sha":"ea1533c45a","sec":50},"female-narrator":{"sha":"10fa0fbd9b","sec":52}}}],"sources":[{"kind":"wiki","title":"Westfall (Classic)","url":"https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Westfall_(Classic)"},{"kind":"wiki","title":"Westfall","url":"https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Westfall"}],"related":[{"p":"/lore/npc/gryan-stoutmantle","n":"Gryan Stoutmantle","k":"npc"},{"p":"/lore/npc/edwin-vancleef","n":"Edwin VanCleef","k":"boss"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/sentinel-hill","n":"Sentinel Hill","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/moonbrook","n":"Moonbrook","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/zone/deadmines","n":"The Deadmines","k":"dungeon"},{"p":"/lore/